    "www_image_with_story_RzcXfx": {
      "type": "www-image-with-story",
      "name": "Why Kerlora exists",
      "settings": {
        "heading": "Why Kerlora Exists",
        "content": "<p>After struggling with health anxiety and the constant overthinking that came with it, founder Kersty Lorton discovered that movement could give her something she hadn’t expected: a sense of calm, clarity and release from the mental fog.</p><p>But when she looked for activewear to support her, she found herself questioning her body and whether she fitted the image of fitness that so many brands portrayed. Exercise wasn’t about perfection for Kersty. It was about showing up, finding strength and feeling better in herself.</p><p>So she created Kerlora.</p><p>Built around the belief that movement should support both body and mind, Kerlora is here to help women feel comfortable, confident and strong, however they choose to move. From the school run to strength training, a walk in the park or simply taking time for yourself, Kerlora is made for real life.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/kerlora-kertsy-founder.webp",
